  "existing_install": "Back up first. Merge UPDATE files; sign into admin.php. From 1.0.8 use Version & database first. If needed, open Administrators to select the initial owner and enable account access. Owners enable Client support explicitly and allow each client under their support agreement. Owners enable Service catalog explicitly for approved prices and existing-project invoice snapshots. Owners enable Payment preparation explicitly. Credential storage requires a private path outside the web document root; production charging remains disabled. Owners may enable Sandbox trials separately for test-card attempts and verification; sandbox results never pay real invoices. Owners may add Sandbox notifications explicitly, then configure the HTTPS sandbox receiver; receipt is disabled by default and queued verification is manual. Owners may enable Invoice payments for external receipts, imported legacy paid balances and client statements; no card processing or refunds are enabled. Owners may enable Website deliveries for reviewed client ZIP releases; PHP ZIP and private storage outside the web root are required for uploads. See CLIENT_DELIVERIES.md for limits and supported scopes. Never rerun fresh setup."
